---
// §6.2 — FounderBio.astro
// Two-column layout: photo (left) + text (right). Stacks on mobile: photo above.
// Bio copy is from the brief (§6.2 verbatim). Humanizer applied: direct sentences, no AI patterns.
// Stat callouts below bio rule.
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-cream">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-20 items-start">

      <!-- Photo column -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="relative">
          <img
            src="/images/founder-photo.jpeg"
            alt="Kingsley Usa, Founder and CEO of Blue Wave Horizon"
            width="600"
            height="600"
            class="w-full rounded-2xl ring-4 ring-primary/20 object-cover aspect-square md:aspect-[4/5]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text column -->
      <div class="reveal">
        <!-- Eyebrow — §6.2 spec -->
        <p
          class="text-secondary font-heading uppercase tracking-widest text-sm font-semibold mb-2"
        >
          Founder &amp; CEO
        </p>

        <!-- Name (H2) — §6.2 spec -->
        <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-4xl md:text-5xl text-ink mb-6 leading-tight">
          Kingsley Usa
        </h2>

        <!-- Bio paragraphs — §6.2 verbatim spec, humanizer applied -->
        <div class="space-y-4 font-body text-ink-mid text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
          <p>
            Kingsley Usa is a full-stack software engineer with a specialisation in backend
            systems, scalable API architecture, and data pipelines. He founded Blue Wave Horizon
            to build the category of software he wished existed — direct, efficient, and built
            with craft.
          </p>
          <p>
            His approach is simple: take full responsibility for outcomes. Every product at
            Blue Wave Horizon is built, shipped, and maintained with that standard.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Divider -->
        <hr class="border-t border-cream-dark mb-8" />

        <!-- Stat callouts — §6.2 spec: two side-by-side small white cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div
            class="bg-white border border-cream-dark rounded-xl p-4"
            style="box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(26,26,46,0.07);"
          >
            <p class="font-heading font-bold text-ink text-lg">2+ Products</p>
            <p class="font-body text-muted text-sm mt-0.5">In active development</p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-white border border-cream-dark rounded-xl p-4"
            style="box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(26,26,46,0.07);"
          >
            <p class="font-heading font-bold text-ink text-lg">Full-Stack</p>
            <p class="font-body text-muted text-sm mt-0.5">Backend, APIs &amp; Data</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
